  "structure": {
    "choice": "One SampleCondPredictor member inside my_cond_branch_predictor.h holding the sR state, and an extension to the LSUM loop in cbp2016_tage_sc_l.h for prediction and update, because sR is a term in the statistical corrector's sum.",
    "rejected_alternatives": [
      {
        "alternative": "A standalone predictor that overrides TAGE-SC-L on every disagreement.",
        "why_rejected": "It made CycWPPKI 43 percent worse because nothing told it how confident its own sum had to be before it overrode a strong predictor.",
        "source": "CBP2025 integration notes"
      }
    ]
  },
  "hook_points": [
    {
      "id": "sc_lsum",
      "file": "cbp2016_tage_sc_l.h",
      "symbol": "cbp2016_tage_sc_l",
      "action": "modify",
      "observed": "Around line 1044 builds LSUM out of one contribution per component, and computes THRES. Around line 1288 the SC updates only under its own conditions.",
      "change": "Add an `LSUM += ...` term for sR before SCPRED is computed, under `if (sr_enabled)`. In the update block, add sR's weight update under the same conditions."
    },
    {
      "id": "sc_update_signature",
      "file": "cbp2016_tage_sc_l.h",
      "symbol": "cbp2016_tage_sc_l::update",
      "action": "modify",
      "observed": "The inner `update` overload takes only the history and does not see the instruction id. The outer one takes `seq_no` and `piece`.",
      "change": "Thread `seq_no` and `piece` into the inner `update` overload so sR can look up the instruction id via `get_unique_inst_id(seq_no, piece)`."
    },
    {
      "id": "contestant_class",
      "file": "my_cond_branch_predictor.h",
      "symbol": "SampleCondPredictor",
      "action": "modify",
      "observed": "`predict_using_given_hist` returns `hist_to_use.tage_pred` unchanged. The class has empty hooks like `notify_instr_decode` and `notify_instr_execute_resolve`.",
      "change": "Add sR's state (Tomasulo table, UT, WT, inflight queue). Implement the register tracking hooks (`notify_instr_decode`, `notify_instr_execute_resolve`). Provide an API for the SC to query sR's prediction term and invoke its update."
    },
    {
